    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Void Corridors</strong> is a first-person puzzle horror game where you navigate a maze-like environment, solve intricate puzzles, and manage limited resources to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for energy to keep your flashlight powered and maintain the generator to illuminate the corridors. Every second of light counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Solve a range of environmental puzzles to unlock new areas, uncover hidden secrets, and descend deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa <strong>Exploration &amp; Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Wander dark, shifting corridors lit by an eerie glow. Stay alert, as it feels like the walls themselves are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 The deeper you go, the more intense the feeling of being observed. Unravel the mystery of the corridors before the presence lurking in the shadows finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the truth\u2014or become lost in the void?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Void Corridors</strong> is a first-person puzzle horror game where you navigate a maze-like environment, solve intricate puzzles, and manage limited resources to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for energy to keep your flashlight powered and maintain the generator to illuminate the corridors. Every second of light counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Solve a range of environmental puzzles to unlock new areas, uncover hidden secrets, and descend deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa <strong>Exploration &amp; Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Wander dark, shifting corridors lit by an eerie glow. Stay alert, as it feels like the walls themselves are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 The deeper you go, the more intense the feeling of being observed. Unravel the mystery of the corridors before the presence lurking in the shadows finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the truth\u2014or become lost in the void?</strong></p>",
